                    {
                        "sense_id": "2137b0a2-39cf-372f-941d-d97042b2fc08",
                        "entry_id": "44ef7ebf-07d0-3fe0-a562-11c10e0b3098",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Eigenschaft, verwundet/gefährdet werden zu können"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb30a02d-c815-46eb-94b3-b6ac27956438",
                                "sense_id": "2137b0a2-39cf-372f-941d-d97042b2fc08",
                                "text": "„Ursache ist nicht nur der Klimawandel, sondern auch die Verwundbarkeit der Menschen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9969063b-1ed0-4dfb-9534-c62908cf970d",
                        "source_entry_id": "44ef7ebf-07d0-3fe0-a562-11c10e0b3098",
                        "source_sense_id": "2137b0a2-39cf-372f-941d-d97042b2fc08",
                        "source_sense_description": "Eigenschaft, verwundet/gefährdet werden zu können",
                        "target_lang_word": "vulnerability",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vulnerability",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "704fab70-5135-3bcd-8e3b-b17f89a50a57",
                                        "entry_id": "9af64d50-4bcd-31ab-8535-43502d909f73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being vulnerable; susceptibility to attack or injury, either physical or emotional; the state or condition of being weak or poorly defended."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "033a5f42-4db2-4b1b-bf8b-77d3021be624",
                                                "sense_id": "704fab70-5135-3bcd-8e3b-b17f89a50a57",
                                                "text": "The country recognized their defence vulnerability after an airplane landed in front of the central square without any consequences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57c4897e-ef3b-4500-96a6-1a1f33def1e2",
                                                "sense_id": "704fab70-5135-3bcd-8e3b-b17f89a50a57",
                                                "text": "Though scientists do not know how stress affects gestation, Fukuda theorizes that the vulnerability of Y-bearing sperm cells, male embryos and/or male fetuses to stress is why “subtle significant changes in sex ratios” occur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3312c718-2bde-4e94-a6dc-e1cce93d5b2b",
                                                "sense_id": "704fab70-5135-3bcd-8e3b-b17f89a50a57",
                                                "text": "Again, voice change is not easy and vulnerability plays a big part, but if choral teachers and adolescent singers approach it with the right mindframe, the experience can be empowering, enlightening, and restorative for all involved."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e28c4723-1864-3b5b-9e94-b0082d6763c3",
                                        "entry_id": "9af64d50-4bcd-31ab-8535-43502d909f73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A specific weakness in the protections or defences surrounding someone or something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dca002a7-eddc-3b56-9bb8-87d7eae5378c",
                                        "entry_id": "9af64d50-4bcd-31ab-8535-43502d909f73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A weakness which allows an attacker to reduce a system's security."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2e82f56-7929-4e88-9a21-b66f51de154b",
                                                "sense_id": "dca002a7-eddc-3b56-9bb8-87d7eae5378c",
                                                "text": "Experts told CNN it could take weeks to address the vulnerabilities and that suspected Chinese hackers are already attempting to exploit it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c88fd2a-2b33-4e34-b7f4-99622fc79bc3",
                        "source_entry_id": "44ef7ebf-07d0-3fe0-a562-11c10e0b3098",
                        "source_sense_id": "2137b0a2-39cf-372f-941d-d97042b2fc08",
                        "source_sense_description": "Eigenschaft, verwundet/gefährdet werden zu können",
                        "target_lang_word": "vulnérabilité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vulnérabilité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c71cf09-3f68-36a0-ad98-1437334d3e05",
                                        "entry_id": "e21eb8bc-dac4-3323-b711-15350814c959",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caractère de ce qui est vulnérable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08f3c33f-6aee-4db3-93b3-b37d1dab0fa6",
                                                "sense_id": "0c71cf09-3f68-36a0-ad98-1437334d3e05",
                                                "text": "Pour mettre cette vulnérabilité en contexte, une vulnérabilité similaire a été utilisée dans le piratage d’Equifax en 2017, qui a conduit à l’exposition en ligne des données personnelles de 149,7 millions de personnes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a7c3c82-ce2f-455d-957b-5bafe70f2b88",
                                                "sense_id": "0c71cf09-3f68-36a0-ad98-1437334d3e05",
                                                "text": "Un système aussi injuste ne peut se maintenir qu’en tenant la population dans l’ignorance et la vulnérabilité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4277c79a-980b-4497-b2a9-dd50342815b5",
                                                "sense_id": "0c71cf09-3f68-36a0-ad98-1437334d3e05",
                                                "text": "En revanche, la vulnérabilité de la vitamine C n’est pas un problème au cours du processus de lacto-fermentation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db1a5824-d19b-4850-950b-f2b58c5008f0",
                                                "sense_id": "0c71cf09-3f68-36a0-ad98-1437334d3e05",
                                                "text": "Concrètement, cela imposera d’avoir des configurations sécurisées avec mises à jour gratuites mais aussi une totale transparence envers le consommateur sur les vulnérabilités."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
